  "text": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestRegressor\nfrom sklearn.inspection import permutation_importance\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nn = 2000\nX = rng.normal(size=(n, 4))\n# от x0 зависимость сильная, от x1 слабее, x2 и x3 — шум\ny = 3 * X[:, 0] + 1.5 * X[:, 1] ** 2 + rng.normal(0, 1, size=n)\n# добавим «мусорный» признак с множеством уникальных значений — номер объекта\nX = np.column_stack([X, rng.permutation(n)])\nnames = ['x0', 'x1', 'x2 (шум)', 'x3 (шум)', 'id (шум)']\nX_tr, X_te, y_tr, y_te = train_test_split(X, y, random_state=0)\n\nrf = RandomForestRegressor(n_estimators=300, random_state=0, n_jobs=-1).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\nperm = permutation_importance(rf, X_te, y_te, n_repeats=10, random_state=0, n_jobs=-1)\n\nprint(f'{\"признак\":10s} {\"MDI\":>6s} {\"permutation\":>12s}')\nfor name, mdi, p in zip(names, rf.feature_importances_, perm.importances_mean):\n    print(f'{name:10s} {mdi:6.3f} {p:12.3f}')",
